d, clean)","hazards":["Dust from sanding compound and existing coatings","Unknown existing coatings","Eye irritation"],"controls":["Vacuum-attached sanders or wet methods","N95 available for voluntary use; respirator where the silica plan or SDS requires","Confirm existing coatings are not lead or asbestos before sanding; if unknown, stop and notify the PM","Safety glasses; HEPA vacuum cleanup"],"osha_refs":"1926.1153 · 1926.62","em385_refs":"","prob":"O","sev":"M"},{"name":"Mask and protect","hazards":["Cuts from blades","Slips on plastic sheeting","Covered exits or fire devices"],"controls":["Retractable blades and cut-resistant gloves","Tape down sheeting edges","Do not cover exits, fire alarm devices, or sprinkler heads without GC approval; uncover at the end of the task"],"osha_refs":"1926.34 · 1926.95","em385_refs":"","prob":"O","sev":"M"},{"name":"Apply by brush and roller","hazards":["Splashes to eyes and skin","Vapors","Strain from repetitive or awkward reaching"],"controls":["Safety glasses and gloves","Ventilate the work area","Stretch before starting; use extension poles; rotate tasks","Position the body to avoid awkward reaching"],"osha_refs":"1910.1200 · 1926.55","em385_refs":"","prob":"S","sev":"M"},{"name":"Set up the airless sprayer","hazards":["High-pressure injection","Electric shock","Trips on hoses"],"controls":["Never use a gun without a tip guard; confirm the trigger lock works","Inspect hose, fittings, and gauge; replace damaged hose","Ground the pump; GFCI on the cord","Route hoses out of walkways"],"osha_refs":"1926.302 · 1926.404(b)","em385_refs":"","prob":"S","sev":"R"},{"name":"Spray with an airless","hazards":["High-pressure fluid injection","Overspray inhalation and eye contact","Overspray on surfaces"],"controls":["Never point the gun at anyone; trigger lock on when not spraying","Unplug and relieve pressure before a tip change, cleaning, or repair","Never clear a clogged tip with a finger or look into it","Replace a leaking hose; nev